flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> WaitForSignal[Wait for signal semaphore]
    WaitForSignal --> ReadData[Read actuator state command servo speed]
    ReadData --> FormatDisplay[Format display strings]
    FormatDisplay --> UpdateLCD[Update LCD with new data]
    UpdateLCD --> CheckReport{10s<br/>elapsed?}
    
    CheckReport -->|yes| PrintReport[Print dual actuator status report]
    CheckReport -->|no| Loop
    
    PrintReport --> Loop((Loop every 500ms))
    Loop --> WaitForSignal

    note[Task: Update LCD display with system status]